    "For a safe set S, blocked(S) is the union of completion sets of triples in S.",
    "Adding p is safe exactly when p is not already in blocked(S).",
    "A safe k-set is maximal exactly when blocked(S) contains all n^2-k outside points.",
    "The score bound uses |blocked(S)| <= sum_T completion_count(T).",
